{"unit_id":"penguin-oo__dsh-pathlink#card-zh","repo":"penguin-oo/dsh-pathlink","commit":"e15516a7b0fdc871b8b537b1a5b39fe9d4900393","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pathlink 是一个面向 DSH 网页客户端的插件：它扫描聊天消息中的文件路径和网址，以 Ctrl 或 macOS 的 ⌘ 加点击触发操作。点击路径时，主机端按会话工作目录和当前工作目录解析并检查路径，再在操作系统文件管理器中打开文件所在目录或目录本身；点击裸链接则在新浏览器标签页打开。用户也可将文件拖放或粘贴到输入框，插件尝试定位本机文件并把路径插入编辑器，无法定位时提供临时副本路径。适合经常从对话跳转到本地文件或将文件路径发给 DSH 的网页用户；需安装在 web profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:73-100","src/client/pathlink-detect.js:1-27","lib/index.js:118-150","cordis.patch.yml:1-16"]}
{"unit_id":"penguin-oo__dsh-pathlink#card-en","repo":"penguin-oo/dsh-pathlink","commit":"e15516a7b0fdc871b8b537b1a5b39fe9d4900393","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pathlink is a DSH web plugin that recognizes file paths and URLs in chat. Ctrl-click (⌘ on macOS) opens paths in the host file manager and links in a new tab. Dropping or pasting a file into the composer inserts its local path, or a temporary copy path when the original cannot be located.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:73-100","src/client/drop.js:1-10","lib/index.js:118-150","cordis.patch.yml:1-16"]}
